Someone kindly sold me a VK100 after my query here, and so my hopes to
bring back an emulation of the VK100 go forward.  I have successfully
gotten the ROMs scanned from the unit, so along with the Technical
Manual, I have made some decent progress!

If anybody has any lost documents relating to the internals of the
VK100, now would be a great time to let me know.  I've scoured all the
usual sites, so what I'm dreaming about is somebody with a firmware
listing, or an internal engineering specification--all the really arcane
stuff.  (I know, it's a long shot.)

