> Will 8-bit devices like the HSD05, RZ26-EA, and BA35X-MG 8-bit i/o
> module work in a 16-bit BA356 enclosure?   Or must I employ 8-bit
> devices only in BA350/BA353 8-bit enclosures?
> 
>   Thank you,
