Hi,

Yes, it is supported to use narrow drives and 8 bit personality modules 
and HSD05/10 in a BA356 enclosure. The rule is that if you use the 
HSD05/10 controllers you can use _only_ narrow drives (i.e RZxxx-VA 
SBB's) in the same enclosure.
The HSD05 might not recognize larger devices than 2.1GB's (i.e 
RZ28x-xx), because of firmware restriction (=age).

Regards,

Kari




